(wire (pts (xy 215.9 406.4) (xy 215.9 408.94)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid c212a1d4-ba0a-43f7-86bf-e0a1bd1c1772))
(label "VBAT" (at 215.9 408.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d279f5ac-2f5f-4490-9290-aadde1df7c15))
(text "Rev 0.3 battery input: J9 (JST PH, pin 1 = +) -> Q3 reverse-polarity P-FET -> VBAT. U9 DW01A + Q5 FS8205A protect in the negative lead (BATT_N -> GND). U8 MAX17048 fuel gauge (I2C 0x36, ALRT -> PA8). VSYS = USB via D4 Schottky, or VBAT via Q4 (off while USB present). VSYS feeds the modem buck and the 3.3V LDO." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f9f2a85a-1d04-474a-a040-6007cd5cfb05))
(text "Power: USB-C 5V in, 3.8V buck for modem VBAT (MCU-switchable), 3.3V LDO for MCU/sensors" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d0a91f58-7f75-5164-8b93-72deef1439a3))
(text "MCU: STM32L072CBT6 (ultra-low-power Cortex-M0+)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 182.88 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a3c2a19a-a4b5-5b1b-83f9-1b1e05bf0412))
(text "Level shift 3.3V <-> 1.8V (VDD_EXT)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 325.12 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9f437654-fda1-5663-9903-3868f472571c))
(text "LTE-M / NB-IoT + GNSS modem: SIMCom SIM7080G" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 421.64 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5b0c003f-913a-5932-883c-f433bac6c7cf))
(text "Nano-SIM" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 523.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 399a3509-e191-5eb5-a23e-d56d18fd7870))
(text "Debug / expansion: SWD, Qwiic I2C for sensors, UART + BOOT0, spare GPIO (J4/J5 DNP)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d82be754-760e-56c7-a5bb-3a10e0f17894))
(text "VBAT decoupling at modem pads, PWRKEY + NETLIGHT drivers, USB download jumper" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 406.4 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f7782c48-9360-5e20-85d3-4a5dbf7fec44))
(text "RF: 50 ohm CPWG to U.FL; C40/C41 pi-match DNP (tune with antenna)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 406.4 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 46c2a952-9ff3-52b4-a5df-6b535179b48f))
(text "Notes: JP1 open = modem USB unpowered (lets modem sleep); bridge JP1 to update modem firmware over USB-C. JP2 + reset = modem USB download mode." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 182.88 370.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c6c053aa-ac68-533e-b9cc-2f3411c12341))
(text "BUCK: Vout = 0.6 x (1 + R7/R8) = 3.93V. U2 EN driven by MCU PB1 (R6 keeps modem off until firmware enables it)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 182.88 378.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 56908d98-aaa9-5621-94a6-bd66607e7717))
(text "U6/J8 footprints: import from LCSC with easyeda2kicad (see README). Verify J8 and U7 pin numbering against the imported footprint/datasheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 182.88 386.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e7f8cc3a-70c8-50c4-81ce-4242197c8440))
